  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.119\n\nReleased on 2026-10-04.\n\nUndoing a freeze frame now removes its still even when extraction is slow. A GSAP call on the playhead fires once when the preview redraws.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio Server:** Freeze still appears whole, so a slow extraction cannot break its undo ([4e118824b301](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4e118824b301cd18b773c28864c2f36ca642ff34), [#4982](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4982)).\n- **Core:** A call on the playhead fires once when the preview redraws it ([a8dcdd109a88](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a8dcdd109a883f43cadaae26bc1b626335d94ec8), [#4981](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4981)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.118...v0.8.119\n"
